<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - B. Stearns starts Rite Aid.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - B. Stearns starts Rite Aid.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns said Thursday it started Rite Aid Corp with an attractive rating.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares off 1/4 at 34-7/8 in early trade.</p>
<p>--E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
